  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pes100.html",
  "prefLabel": "Pes 101.15 \"Label\" or \"labeling\" means",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 101.15 \"Label\" or \"labeling\" means:\n\n(a) The written, printed, or graphic matter on, or attached to, the pesticide, or the immediate container thereon;\n\n(b) The outside container or wrapper of the retail package, if there is one, of the pesticide; and\n\n(c) Written printed or graphic matter which is incorporated into the label by reference.\n\nSource. #6047, eff 6-3-95; ss and moved by #6239, eff 5-2-96 (formerly Pes 101.131)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pes100.html"
